{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07373","headline":"送元八游汝南 · 刘长卿","name":"送元八游汝南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元生实奇迈，幸此论畴昔。\n刀笔素推高，锋鋩久无敌。\n纵横济时意，跌宕过人蹟。\n破产供酒钱，盈门皆食客。\n田园顷失计，资用深相迫。\n生事诚可忧，严装远何适。\n世情薄恩义，俗态轻穷厄。\n四海金虽多，其如向人惜。\n迢递朗陵道，怅望都门夕。\n向别伊水南，行看楚云隔。\n繁蝉动高柳，疋马嘶平泽。\n潢潦今正深，陂湖未澄碧。\n人生不得已，自可甘形役。\n勿复尊前酒，离居剩凄戚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}